# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Ethically Acquired Antiquities/Journal" by tools/quests/journals_from_wiki.py; set a step's stage to pin it.
step	1	-	Getting started
line	<col=000080>I can start this quest by investigating the <col=800000>Empty Display</col> on the ground floor of the <col=800000>Grand Museum</col> in <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Talking to the curator
step	3	-	Looking for clues
line	<col=000080>I noticed an <col=800000>Empty Display</col> in the <col=800000>Grand Museum</col> of <col=800000>Civitas Illa Fortis</col>. The <col=800000>Display</col> apparently contained <col=800000>Xerna's Diadem</col>, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the <col=800000>Museum Curator</col> and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the <col=800000>Diadem</col>. I should start by investigating the <col=800000>Museum</col> for clues.</col>
step	4	-	Asking around
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
line	<col=000080>I had a look around the <col=800000>Museum</col> and found evidence that the <col=800000>Diadem</col> had been stolen by a <col=800000>Professional Thief</col>. I should ask around and see if anyone saw anything suspicious.</col>
step	5	-	The Quetzal Landing Site
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
line	<col=000080>I had a look around the <col=800000>Museum</col> and found evidence that the <col=800000>Diadem</col> had been stolen by a <col=800000>Professional Thief</col>. I asked around and someone mentioned they saw a <col=800000>Suspicious-Looking Person</col> leaving the <col=800000>Museum</col> before heading to the nearby <col=800000>Quetzal Landing Site</col>. I should investigate this.</col>
step	6	-	Forthis Cothon
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
line	<str>I had a look around the Museum and found evidence that the Diadem had been stolen by a Professional Thief. I asked around and someone mentioned they saw a Suspicious-Looking Person leaving the Museum before heading to the nearby Quetzal Landing Site.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Regulus Cento</col> at the <col=800000>Quetzal Landing Site</col> and he told me that a <col=800000>Suspicious-Looking Man</col> carrying a <col=800000>Case</col> wanted to use one of the <col=800000>Quetzals</col>. After being turned away, this <col=800000>Man</col> apparently headed towards the <col=800000>Fortis Cothon</col>.</col>
step	7	-	Before agreeing to do a favour for the Trader Crew
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
line	<str>I had a look around the Museum and found evidence that the Diadem had been stolen by a Professional Thief. I asked around and someone mentioned they saw a Suspicious-Looking Person leaving the Museum before heading to the nearby Quetzal Landing Site.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Regulus Cento at the Quetzal Landing Site and he told me that a Suspicious-Looking Ma carrying a Case wanted to use one of the Quetzals. After being turned away, this Man apparently headed towards the Fortis Cathon.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to the members of the <col=800000>Trader Crew</col> in the <col=800000>Fortis Cothon</col>. They agreed to provide information in return for a favour. I should speak to them again and see what they want.</col>
step	8	-	Fixing the sails
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
line	<str>I had a look around the Museum and found evidence that the Diadem had been stolen by a Professional Thief. I asked around and someone mentioned they saw a Suspicious-Looking Person leaving the Museum before heading to the nearby Quetzal Landing Site.</str>
