line	<col=000080>I spoke to the members of the <col=800000>Trader Crew</col> in the <col=800000>Fortis Cothon</col>. They agreed to provide information in return for a favour. They asked me to take their <col=800000>Tattered Sails</col> to the nearby <col=800000>Crafting Store</col> to have them repaired.</col>
