step	13	-	Deciphering the notes
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
line	<str>I had a look around the Museum and found evidence that the Diadem had been stolen by a Professional Thief. I asked around and someone mentioned they saw a Suspicious-Looking Person leaving the Museum before heading to the nearby Quetzal Landing Site.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Regulus Cento at the Quetzal Landing Site and he told me that a Suspicious-Looking Ma carrying a Case wanted to use one of the Quetzals. After being turned away, this Man apparently headed towards the Fortis Cathon.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to members of the Trader Crew in the Fortis Cothon. They agreed to provide information in return for a favour. At their request, I took their Tattered Sails to the nearby Crafting Store to have them repaired. In return, they told me that a Grey-Haired Man carrying a Case recently booked passage to Port Sarim.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to the members of the Trader Crew in Port Sarim. They told me that after disembarking, the Grey-Haired Man carrying a Case headed north while talking abour Runes.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Betty</col> in her <col=800000>Magic Shop</col> in <col=800000>Port Sarim</col>. She told me that the <col=800000>Grey-Haired Man</col> carrying a <col=800000>Case</col> came in to buy some <col=800000>Runes</col>, but left as she didn't sell the ones he was after. She said she made some <col=800000>Notes</col> detailing which ones he wanted. She also mentioned that he was wearing a <col=800000>Monocle</col>. Between these <col=800000>Notes</col> and the description I have of him, I can hopefully track him down.</col>
