line	<str>I spoke to members of the Trader Crew in the Fortis Cothon. They agreed to provide information in return for a favour. At their request, I took their Tattered Sails to the nearby Crafting Store to have them repaired. In return, they told me that a Grey-Haired Man carrying a Case recently booked passage to Port Sarim.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to the members of the Trader Crew in Port Sarim. They told me that after disembarking, the Grey-Haired Man carrying a Case headed north while talking abour Runes.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Betty in her Magic Shop in Port Sarim. She told me that the Grey-Haired Man carrying a Case came in to buy some Runes, but left as she didn't sell the ones he was after. She said she made some Notes detailing which ones he wanted. She also mentioned that he was wearing a Monocle.</str>
line	<col=000080>I managed to work out that the <col=800000>Grey-Haired Man</col> was travelling to <col=800000>Varrock</col>. I travelled there myself and confronted <col=800000>Curator Haig Halen</col> in the <col=800000>Varrock Museum</col> about <col=800000>Xerna's Diadem</col>. He claimed not to know anything, but I might want to do some investigating all the same.</col>
step	15	-	Finding the Diadem
line	<str>I noticed an Empty Display in the Grand Museum of Civitas Illa Fortis. The Display apparently contained Xerna's Diadem, but it was recently stolen. I spoke to the Museum Curator and he offered me a reward in return for recovering the Diadem.</str>
