line	<col=000080>I managed to steal a <col=800000>Storeroom Key</col> from <col=800000>Haig Halen</col>. I used it to enter the <col=800000>Varrock Museum Storeroom</col> where I found <col=800000>Xerna's Diadem</col>. I should confront <col=800000>Haig Halen</col> about this.</col>
